      <div id="MS4208Discription" data-tchmi-type="TcHmi.Controls.Beckhoff.TcHmiTextblock" data-tchmi-height-unit="%" data-tchmi-left="0" data-tchmi-left-unit="%" data-tchmi-text="The MS4208-2003-1112
2-chanel EtherCAT  power output module provides 24 V DC for the control voltage US or the load voltage UP as well as EtherCAT for additional consumers. Both voltages are protected by integrated electronic fuses; the load voltage UP can also be switched. Two channels are supplied via separate connectors.

Supply additional baseplates or any external devices with voltages and integrate them into the EtherCAT network." data-tchmi-top="0" data-tchmi-top-unit="%" data-tchmi-width-unit="%" data-tchmi-word-wrap="True" data-tchmi-right-unit="%" data-tchmi-bottom-unit="%" data-tchmi-right="0" data-tchmi-bottom="0" data-tchmi-text-font-size="150" data-tchmi-text-font-size-unit="%">
</div>
</div>

